{"q":"32","t":"Longest Valid Parentheses","d":"Hard","p":false,"c":"<p>Given a string containing just the characters <code>&#39;(&#39;</code> and <code>&#39;)&#39;</code>, return <em>the length of the longest valid (well-formed) parentheses </em><span data-keyword=\"substring-nonempty\"><em>substring</em></span>.</p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><strong class=\"example\">Example 1:</strong></p>\n\n<pre>\n<strong>Input:</strong> s = &quot;(()&quot;\n<strong>Output:</strong> 2\n<strong>Explanation:</strong> The longest valid parentheses substring is &quot;()&quot;.\n</pre>\n\n<p><strong class=\"example\">Example 2:</strong></p>\n\n<pre>\n<strong>Input:</strong> s = &quot;)()())&quot;\n<strong>Output:</strong> 4\n<strong>Explanation:</strong> The longest valid parentheses substring is &quot;()()&quot;.\n</pre>\n\n<p><strong class=\"example\">Example 3:</strong></p>\n\n<pre>\n<strong>Input:</strong> s = &quot;&quot;\n<strong>Output:</strong> 0\n</pre>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><strong>Constraints:</strong></p>\n\n<ul>\n\t<li><code>0 &lt;= s.length &lt;= 3 * 10<sup>4</sup></code></li>\n\t<li><code>s[i]</code> is <code>&#39;(&#39;</code>, or <code>&#39;)&#39;</code>.</li>\n</ul>\n","h":[],"m":"{ \r\n  \"name\": \"longestValidParentheses\",\r\n  \"params\": [\r\n    { \r\n      \"name\": \"s\",\r\n      \"type\": \"string\"\r\n    }\r\n  ],\r\n  \"return\": {\r\n    \"type\": \"integer\"\r\n  }\r\n}","g":[{"name":"String","slug":"string"},{"name":"Dynamic Programming","slug":"dynamic-programming"},{"name":"Stack","slug":"stack"},{"name":"Bracket Sequences","slug":"bracket-sequences"}],"s":[{"t":"Valid Parentheses","s":"valid-parentheses","d":"Easy","p":false}],"co":[["Amazon","amazon"],["Google","google"],["Meta","facebook"],["Microsoft","microsoft"],["Bloomberg","bloomberg"],["TikTok","tiktok"],["Visa","visa"],["IBM","ibm"],["Accenture","accenture"],["Nykaa","nykaa"],["Uber","uber"],["Zoho","zoho"],["Nike","nike"],["Oracle","oracle"],["Intuit","intuit"],["Morgan Stanley","morgan-stanley"],["DE Shaw","de-shaw"],["InMobi","inmobi"],["MakeMyTrip","makemytrip"],["Roku","roku"]],"cs":{"a":[["Amazon","amazon",4],["Google","google",3],["Meta","facebook",2]],"b":[["Microsoft","microsoft",4],["Bloomberg","bloomberg",2],["TikTok","tiktok",2],["Visa","visa",2]],"m":[["Zoho","zoho",6],["LinkedIn","linkedin",5],["IBM","ibm",3],["Uber","uber",3],["Nike","nike",3],["Nykaa","nykaa",3],["Oracle","oracle",2],["DE Shaw","de-shaw",2],["Intuit","intuit",2],["Accenture","accenture",2]]}}